    "detailed_description": "<strong>\u201cReach the light\u201d is a difficult precision platformer with varied challenges throughout the world. Although the hardest one is the one that takes you to the light\u2026</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple platforms with tricky behaviors and mechanics.<br></li><li>Ball costumes.<br></li><li>Extra challenges to beat.<br></li><li>Twitch integration.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/522b98ed13a49b6dfebc7105abd0499f.poster.avif?t=1726014598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/522b98ed13a49b6dfebc7105abd0499f.webm?t=1726014598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/522b98ed13a49b6dfebc7105abd0499f.mp4?t=1726014598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Use two jumps that are recharged over time to climb the mountain. It is a hard challenge to maintain balance and make accurate jumps on platforms.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/07d22c60f60a979c75041c3b27bcaf8f.poster.avif?t=1726014598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/07d22c60f60a979c75041c3b27bcaf8f.webm?t=1726014598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/07d22c60f60a979c75041c3b27bcaf8f.mp4?t=1726014598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Along the mountain you will find checkpoints that divide the large map into sections.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/7cdef8b8d32f6b16d764bb02671d657c.poster.avif?t=1726014598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/7cdef8b8d32f6b16d764bb02671d657c.webm?t=1726014598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/7cdef8b8d32f6b16d764bb02671d657c.mp4?t=1726014598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
